Package: scfaReporter
Title: Reproducible Short-Chain Fatty Acid Reporting Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Microbiome", "Insights", email = "info@microbiomeinsights.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Data Science Team", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Provides end-to-end helpers for importing Thermo Chromeleon SCFA
    chromatogram exports, joining them with sample manifests, normalizing
    concentrations, fitting ANOVA or mixed-effects models (with emmeans
    contrasts), and rendering the bundled Quarto report template used for
    collaborator deliverables. Includes demo datasets and manifests for quick
    testing.
